    <title>MySnippingTool</title>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:55:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.5.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixed: Capture Text (OCR) found no text when the selected area was wide, such as most of a large or Retina screen. Wide areas are now read in full, and small text in them is recognized more reliably.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.5.1/MySnippingTool-1.5.1.zip" length="2321528" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="4tm12gW/B76Wg+T6hl5E29rvquL2HWKE5SP/kMSxQzxwZIwa+d9ArnhfBnBnmGypqAeXV0C2dYtzigxzbqWGDQ=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.5.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:35:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.5.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New: Capture Full Page (⌥⇧⌘8). Click a browser window and MySnippingTool scrolls the page from top to bottom on its own and saves it as one tall image. It asks for Accessibility access the first time, so it can scroll the page for you.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.5.0/MySnippingTool-1.5.0.zip" length="2316009" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7KYIPPv4sN4WeC9KqziAQ9Mxl4G3xAVYcHvbYb5ADJ7RHVm+jZ/R1nbTNPe8znxy3melHuRXLNONqABXhREKCg=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.4.3</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:03:18 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.4.3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Images sent from other apps (such as Edit in MySnippingTool from MyPaste) now reuse an untouched editor window instead of opening a new one each time, so windows no longer pile up. Editors with changes and new screenshots keep their own window.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.4.3/MySnippingTool-1.4.3.zip" length="2293949" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="SbSH19/QZsAUxapm/lW9cuU63QS3oDwUig1c07Np5hzhZhjbijvP29pfC8UBgZagyFStDi7a3FP3u/Rpcdf6Cg=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.4.2</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 05:03:26 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.4.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Cleaner editor toolbar: only the Save button and the copy icon remain. The shortcuts ⌘T (copy text), ⌘P (pin) and ⇧⌘S (save as) still work.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.4.2/MySnippingTool-1.4.2.zip" length="2293593" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Z6bGhv18OGEilJ68tmruSaN0IgYJ2QbcZPMNttiqzZWUxykBbXbsG1YkGe1pfJmHe7n8dlD9WMGvNVJXHg95Aw=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.4.1</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 20:00:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.4.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The update window is now always in English.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.4.1/MySnippingTool-1.4.1.zip" length="2300988" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="tHi3XK59rJPb8CGagssnlyBs8ToksxCw8TdHmvjqZxMe5Ns2+EC9/vjtAxBpN+HA0DyzL7nEIH/eBOV2um/RAg=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.4.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:40:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.4.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>You can now open images in the editor from other apps: with “Open With” in the Finder or with “Edit in MySnippingTool” in MyPaste.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.4.0/MySnippingTool-1.4.0.zip" length="2416717" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="WEkUw3DxjHWM3Ml4uKFIGPWUwSSBKiwWU+27suoMv3mGqx8Gf2EbfnMEG7q2ZLkMhci84VnzTg7MCa1tznunBA=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:36:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.3.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Picking a color is easier: in the editor, ⌘-click the image to copy the color at that point and draw with it. ⌘⇧-click does the same with the text color.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.3.0/MySnippingTool-1.3.0.zip" length="2416352" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="poQSIBqMEUGBpxngj9cP8UOrSPHUTa++HZeMVSupav2CMM4o6ZTQJuz22l1sK0/i6Q7eQgVUfarppgLtfW6dDw=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.2.1</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:45:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The editor now opens automatically after every capture. If you prefer the floating thumbnail, change it in Settings → General → After a capture.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.2.1/MySnippingTool-1.2.1.zip" length="2415756" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="pV1WfGqAAngHeMr8Rpmp417fg264+ZbOqxvHY0vfKIHjsPLdkWVMVimETE8ZILQk05W2M3ypBrpWu+RAw3UIDw=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:42:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Better color picking: the editor shows the color under the pointer live. ⇥ copies that pixel, ⇧⇥ copies the text color, and the new eyedropper tool (I) copies the average color of an area as you drag. The screen eyedropper works the same way. Clicking the color lets you choose the format (HEX, RGB or HSL).</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.2.0/MySnippingTool-1.2.0.zip" length="2415706" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Jqvc/zf1tQ5S4EiXn4a9kz0FH8OsU+XkM3Xe1orUGroN+p2cb3y1a8TfYkUAEuHris3aZaisAc5QwXgw9pLEDA=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MySnippingTool 1.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:38:36 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.1.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Arrows can now bend: when you draw an arrow, handles appear to move its ends, plus a middle handle to curve it. With the selection tool, click any arrow to edit it again.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mysnippingtool-v1.1.0/MySnippingTool-1.1.0.zip" length="2393011" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lpZ8MuM2MdOsgymoKROVRv2YMmKOM22rMuxSj+SKhRF2M824G0LajmvGPG0xfDWs9BhAt3O9qCVZa7yuCiwIBg=="/>
    </item>
